      "id": 21703,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "### Summary\nUser can use the same session token after logout. Attacker can repeat request with token that should be marked as invalidated `https://affiliates.kromtech.com`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\nRequest made after Logout with the same cookie value.\n\n`curl -i -s -k -X $'GET' \\\n-H $'Host: affiliates.kromtech.com' -H $'Cookie: sid=91iqik6qtblp0vsu9b5j7fgal0;' \\\n-b $'sid=91iqik6qtblp0vsu9b5j7fgal0' \\\n$'https://affiliates.kromtech.com/account'`",
